ent counts from the leaderboard.\n- \"Why Activity\" bento: example builder history with a segmented score\n  bar and live updates, a 1-2-3 signing flow, an animated beam showing\n  events fanning out, a re-ranking scoring demo, endorsements, and a\n  GitHub polling stack.\n- Live events and top builders, with weekly falling back to all-time,\n  and a scrolling strip of publishing projects.\n- Integration steps with send and read code samples, a final call to\n  action, and a footer with the NEAR Builders logo.\n- Ports Magic UI''s Number Ticker, Border Beam, Animated Beam, Animated\n  List and Marquee onto the existing framer-motion dependency.\n- Moves the starter template''s tenant list from / to /tenants.\n- Login explains what signing in is for and links back to the landing\n  page; the header logo now goes to /.\n- All animation respects reduced motion.","tree":{"sha":"d923af1080a2aac1ba2bf3bd87e0371930865675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/d923af1080a2aac1ba2bf3bd87e0371930865675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/c16a5013943f36aa3188e90970aca85ca90bd3a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/