D or NEAR account),\n  validate the Source ID as it is typed, avoid prefilling an account that\n  already owns a source, and restyle the form with one card per event\n  type.\n- Replace the disclosure toggle with a Register another source button.\n- Put the admin review queue and trust controls in tabs.\n- Use the header''s brand accent for primary buttons and the stepper.","tree":{"sha":"aa16a0d63668ffbc4e4f3cbd8b4510129693a939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/aa16a0d63668ffbc4e4f3cbd8b4510129693a939"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/c210ddb2b9a0eb432fcd772139e4b1a6bced4190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/c210ddb2b9a0eb432fcd772139e4b1a6bced4190","node_id":"C_kwDOULJws9oAKGMyMTBkZGIyYjlhMGViNDMyZmNkNzcyMTM5ZTRiMWE2YmNlZDQxOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/105b8396728ab30a9740c94258dc1e376d66bb0c","sha":"105b8396728ab30a9740c94258dc1e376d66bb0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/105b8396728ab30a9740c94258dc1e376d66bb0c"}],"sha":"c210ddb2b9a0eb432fcd772139e4b1a6bced4190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/c210ddb2b9a0eb432fcd772139e4b1a6bced4190"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/105b8396728ab30a9740c94258dc1e376d66bb0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:30:33Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:30:33Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"feat: guided setup wizard and cheaper on-chain binding for Activity Sources\n\nOnboarding a source previously meant meeting each requirement as a\nsurprise: a text-only wallet prompt, an org picker with nothing to click,\ncredentials hidden in a collapsed section, and a binding transaction that\nneeded ~0.3 NEAR.\n\n- Add a setup wizard to /activity-sources that tracks six steps and\n  renders each step''s action in place: connect wallet, pick an org,\n  register, wait for approval, link on-chain, create an API key.\n- Finish with the new API key and a ready-to-run curl for the first event.\n- Merge signing-identity creation into the on-chain link step and poll for\n  indexing automatically.\n- Lower the binding transaction to 20 TGas and no deposit. Mainnet calls\n  to contextual.near use about 1.45 TGas and succeed without a deposit;\n  the fee is now about 0.0001 NEAR.\n- Detect when the signed-in NEAR account cannot link the source and say\n  which account is needed; clarify the server error likewise.\n- Reconnect and retry once when the remembered wallet session is stale.\n- Check org role before NEAR auth so signed-out users get 401, not 403.\n- Update the integration guide for the new cost and flow.","tree":{"sha":"a44fefbdd003c0a87dcd5be3d7029d736ac0109f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/a44fefbdd003c0a87dcd5be3d7029d736ac0109f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/105b8396728ab30a9740c94258dc1e376d66bb0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","no