,"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/b75bf8eb951e665d5ab6381a3eaa835186d18bc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:04:53Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:04:53Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"fix(ui): render fenced code blocks as blocks, and stop serving stale docs\n\nTwo bugs found while reviewing the rendered guides.\n\nrehype-highlight rewrites a fenced block''s class to ''hljs language-bash'',\nso the language is no longer the first token. The code component matched\nonly the start of the class, so every fenced block on every page fell\nthrough to the inline-code branch and was rendered with the inline chip\nbackground and border instead of as a code block. This affected /skill\nas well. Matching any class token fixes it, and syntax highlighting now\nshows.\n\nThe docs loaders fetched generated files at stable URLs with default\ncache semantics, so a reader kept seeing the previous version after a\ndeploy until their cache expired. This was reproducible locally: the\npage rendered old content while the server served new. Both fetches now\nrevalidate, which still allows a 304.\n\nAlso adds callouts for the constraints people miss, and a diagram of\nwhat happens to a submitted event, to break up the prose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014DEs6bFdQvtKDkSHHecRQU","tree":{"sha":"4df9ba76368106cb16c6cb10ccec0eb952ec8359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/4df9ba76368106cb16c6cb10ccec0eb952ec8359"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/b75bf8eb951e665d5ab6381a3eaa835186d18bc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/b75bf8eb951e665d5ab6381a3eaa835186d18bc1","node_id":"C_kwDOULJws9oAKGI3NWJmOGViOTUxZTY2NWQ1YWI2MzgxYTNlYWE4MzUxODZkMThiYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa","sha":"511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa"}],"sha":"b75bf8eb951e665d5ab6381a3eaa835186d18bc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/b75bf8eb951e665d5ab6381a3eaa835186d18bc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:35:04Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:35:04Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"feat(ui): add a table of contents and widen the docs layout\n\nThe guide pages read as a wall of text: roughly half the screen was\nempty, a long document had no way to navigate or show where you are,\nand the title appeared twice because the page header and the Markdown\nboth rendered it.\n\n- The sync script now extracts section headings, using the same slugger\n  rehype-slug uses when rendering, so every entry links to a heading\n  that exists. It also strips the leading title.\n- A sticky table of contents fills the empty column and highlights the\n  section being read. It is hidden below the large breakpoint, where\n  there is no room for it.\n- Pages use the wide container, and each one ends with links to the\n  other guides.\n\nAlso fills two gaps found by comparing the guide against the contract:\nendorsements and the health endpoint were public routes that no guide\nmentioned. Sections renumbered accordingly, and every in-page anchor is\nverified to resolve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014DEs6bFdQvtKDkSHHecRQU","tree":{"sha":"7f1e144c6b30e4d844ae103fcae32f181bec7f16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/7f1e144c6b30e4d844ae103fcae32f181bec7f16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/511f185f723e073d8db9ebd97324778423618ffa","node_id":"C_kwDOULJws9oAKDUxMWYxODVmNzIzZTA3M2Q4ZGI5ZWJkOTczMjQ3Nzg0MjM2MThmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698","sha":"fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698","url":"https://api.g