url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/81a503e96ac6ec6a118e261f92136afeac1698c3","node_id":"C_kwDOULJws9oAKDgxYTUwM2U5NmFjNmVjNmExMThlMjYxZjkyMTM2YWZlYWMxNjk4YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/103347a25f87c941db5e255828473790f5c0a731","sha":"103347a25f87c941db5e255828473790f5c0a731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/103347a25f87c941db5e255828473790f5c0a731"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commit/fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698","sha":"fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698"}],"sha":"81a503e96ac6ec6a118e261f92136afeac1698c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/81a503e96ac6ec6a118e261f92136afeac1698c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/fffed2cbb2bac11970f0ccd8328b6272d885a698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:16:01Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:16:01Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"feat(ui): publish the guides at /docs, and document the RPC surface\n\nExternal integrators land on activity.nearbuilders.org, not on a docs/\nfolder in the repository. The site could show them the OpenAPI reference\nbut not how to use it, so the guides now render on the site.\n\ndocs/ stays the single source of truth. scripts/sync-docs.ts publishes\nthe selected documents into ui/public/docs/, rewriting relative links so\na link to a published document becomes a site route and anything else\nbecomes a GitHub link, and CI fails if the published copies are stale.\n\nGuide changes, both from review feedback:\n\n- A ''Before you start'' section states that Activity is a plain HTTP API\n  with nothing to install, lists what is needed up front, and gives an\n  honest timing table. Approval waits on a human and the signing key\n  needs an on-chain binding, so ''first event in ten minutes'' only holds\n  once those are arranged.\n- A new section covers the oRPC surface at /api/rpc, verified against\n  production: it authenticates identically, and is the better path\n  inside everything.dev where the contract is generated. Outside it, the\n  contract is not installable, so an oRPC client is untyped and the HTTP\n  calls are better.\n\nCo-Authored-By: 