"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/f3552b6619b8911a3a7c059ddb05f4132528dd00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:22:26Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:22:26Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"docs: add activity-ui-revamp ADR (#31)\n\nSettles the three things #31 asks this ADR for: a design-direction\nwriteup grounded in what PR #35 already shipped (not proposing it\nagain), an anti-pattern list built from the product owner''s own\nverbatim feedback on that redesign (still-present Card-everywhere\nusage, stacked-header pattern, an SSR-fallback regression) rather than\ninvented after the fact, and the Tailwind/shadcn keep-vs-remove call.\n\nAlso corrects two stale assumptions in the issue text itself, verified\nagainst the current codebase rather than assumed: `/` is not a\nredirect into `/activity` today (it''s the inherited everything.dev\ntenant-list page, and it requires login — the opposite of #31''s public\n`/` requirement), and `/things/*` no longer exists (already removed by\n62ef715, predates this ADR).\n\nPer #31: implementation should not start before this is merged, and\nshould be split into tracer-bullet tickets via /to-tickets afterward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014DEs6bFdQvtKDkSHHecRQU","tree":{"sha":"84a1aa33e2a6405996b53eee4f1c5e300ecbbec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/84a1aa33e2a6405996b53eee4f1c5e300ecbbec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/f3552b6619b8911a3a7c059ddb05f4132528dd00","verification":{"payl