email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:14:26Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"fix: correct bun --if-present flag placement and guard empty plugins glob\n\nCI''s test step failed with CACError: Unknown option `--ifPresent` —\n`--if-present` after the script name forwards it to the script itself\n(vitest) instead of bun. Also guard the `plugins/*` glob in the test\nscript the same way typecheck already does: with no plugins/ directory\npresent, the unguarded loop''s last executed command is a failing\n`[ -f ... ]` test, which fails the whole script even when every actual\ntest passed.\n\nVerified locally with .env removed (matching CI''s clean checkout):\nbun run test exits 0, 149/149 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014DEs6bFdQvtKDkSHHecRQU","tree":{"sha":"589fb359af76d18c28eec74aecba289b5e7dac31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/589fb359af76d18c28eec74aecba289b5e7dac31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/528192c5c591ad56115ab7388181bfb8902f0397","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saadiqbal-dev","id":165388405,"login":"saadiqbal-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCdugdQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us