om/users/saadiqbal-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/commits/ffe8d219ab56f1a3e36d5fd291b388ea79da70e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:06:41Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:06:41Z","email":"saadiqbal.dev@outlook.com","name":"saadiqbal-dev"},"message":"fix: unblock local dev onboarding (#29, #30, #33)\n\nAdds bun run first-run/setup:check (#30), compose:doctor as a predev\nguard against the redis-6379 collision (#29), and the Nostr plugin\nsurface study for RFC #32 (#33). Also fixes a real bug found while\nverifying the local server actually runs: api/plugin.dev.ts loaded\n.env relative to process.cwd() (api/ under bos dev), so every local\nenv override was silently ignored regardless of value. Adds\nACTIVITY_LOCAL_RELAY_ONLY to bypass the shared Nostr plugin''s remote\nRPC for local dev, since that transport is always used even locally\nand can''t reach a local-only relay URL. Adds bun run seed:demo for\npopulating a local UI with real, signature-verified demo data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014DEs6bFdQvtKDkSHHecRQU","tree":{"sha":"c6463d5c13dd5f540c059707cfdf3b827bb37507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/c6463d5c13dd5f540c059707cfdf3b827bb37507"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/activity.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/ffe8d219ab56f1a3e36d5fd291b388ea79da70e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165388405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqbal-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saadiqba