s{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sebastienbarbier","id":3018618,"login":"sebastienbarbier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTg2MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/hosting-service/commits/fcb8fee3d7715d2698ce4af706dee5bc24f1cb86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:30:25Z","email":"3018618+sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sébastien Barbier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:30:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Shellui Actions webhook delivery for hosting events (#27)\n\n* Add Shellui Actions webhook delivery for hosting events\n\nPort identity-service webhook outbox pattern: emit on domain changes,\npost-commit HTTP delivery, DB-backed retries via retry_webhooks, and\nadmin REST API under /api/v1/actions/ for the Shellui admin app.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Improve n8n webhook retry, signing, and documentation\n\nTreat HTTP 404 as retryable; narrow permanent 4xx codes; honor\nRetry-After on 429/503. UTF-8 JSON bodies, whsec_ secrets, Shellui\nheaders, and docs/n8n.md with verifier snippets.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Align Shellui Actions with identity n8n canonical modules\n\nMatch webhook_retry and webhook_signing to identity-service, WebhookPostResult\ntransport, max(backoff, Retry-After), auto-generated secrets, rotate-secret\nAPI, has_secret/secret_hint masking, and Node verifier example.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix HTTPS webhooks with PinnedHTTPSConnection for TLS SNI\n\nConnect to SSRF-pinned IP while verifying certificates for the original\nhostname. Add transport unit and localhost HTTPS integration tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Sync apps/actions transport and sample_data with identity-service\n\nByte-identical webhook_transport from identity PR #59, port sample_data\nand unique send-test payloads from PR #60.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2efed2778429fa8d16bb182cdee4fd271a8a3776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/hosting-service/git/trees/2efed2778429fa8d16bb182cdee4fd271a8a3776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/hosting-service/git/commits/fcb8fee3d7715d2698ce4af706dee5bc24f1cb86","verification":{"payload":"tree 2efed2778429fa8d16bb182cdee4fd271a8a3776\nparent 6ae8a9fc3d34ef1dd3d9281dc34cfe5849e3249a\nauthor Sébastien Barbier <3018618+sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com> 1790688625 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790688625 +0200\n\nAdd Shellui Actions webhook delivery for hosting events (#27)\n\n* Add Shellui Actions webhook delivery for hosting events\n\nPort identity-service webhook outbox pattern: emit on domain changes,\npost-commit HTTP delivery, DB-backed retries via retry_webhooks, and\nadmin REST API under /api/v1/actions/ for the Shellui admin app.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Improve n8n webhook retry, signing, and documentation\n\nTreat HTTP 404 as retryable; narrow permanent 4xx codes; honor\nRetry-After on 429/503. UTF-8 JSON bodies, whsec_ secrets, Shellui\nheaders, and docs/n8n.md with verifier snippets.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Align Shellui Actions with identity n8n canonical modules\n\nMatch webhook_retry and webhook_signing to identity-service, WebhookPostResult\ntransport, max(backoff, Retry-After), auto-generated secrets, rotate-secret\nAPI, has_secret/secret_hint masking, and Node verifier example.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix HTTPS webhooks with PinnedHTTPSConnection for TLS SNI\n\nConnect to SSRF-pinned IP while verifying certificates for the original\nhostname. Add transport unit and localhost HTTPS integration tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Sync apps/actions transport and sample_data with identity-service\n\nByte-identical webhook_transport from identity PR #59, port sample_data\nand unique send-test payloads from PR #60.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu71xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7QQQACndeEh5CNDjrIODwXk+hmoH\nuBCPD8b7cOM99JNpOQf+mojID8ESNcbNnAnXSDkpaY4cCscVPjhmRzGIJT6kV+Ix\nkueEqN6aTSEkgydBfoLlCUgkcP/ZEbpG2TrmIACb/x0x165V2myf0E7yRT5lEl1N\n3F5X3onkqzyenHQDLw0MWgBifXDJIWtrwEpOukxU9eCWqQ/NdwdPt/bBo+6Tqglg\nQGOnyZI3ej47aYsEXOXHbalkWexTUSM53n32x7C1zruZZXYYett/EnI4DZnQ9dY6\nVOjpJ76p07te1kgv5XRYPGZNRWrsWqL2FahboLhWo+2UFrc3fdB57K6HZc04clp9\n5kAh1EA5nwvks4OWrWC+zzDistwMy4BQWKupZeloswXkschstJdk+fx5UHjyZ7f/\nSKVZ0MMb