via --slug/--app-host, and\nsecurity headers. Document in README and PUBLISH.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"18595f4b921405fd380f4d85023022e9c9b80aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/hosting-service/git/trees/18595f4b921405fd380f4d85023022e9c9b80aa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/hosting-service/git/commits/cdd0ebbbe8d580f9d5dcd3556f4a4f247be81c53","verification":{"payload":"tree 18595f4b921405fd380f4d85023022e9c9b80aa5\nparent f9f705f60588d6574fb4711964df4522ed457322\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789716117 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789716117 +0000\n\nAdd prod-config-check.sh for deployed hosting instances\n\nFixes #13\n\nPost-deploy smoke script (modeled on identity-service) verifies HTTPS\nreachability, protected /hosting/v1/* auth boundaries, health + llms.txt,\nbootstrap gate, CORS, optional app-host smoke via --slug/--app-host, and\nsecurity headers. Document in README and PUBLISH.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sébastien Barbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDCuSHjgUw4LERDziQe/0d9oCIe7OybsLy6oTfC+tOdghucU7JWXKVYwVlZzM+zOex\nUCTQEpux0xjNEs1/FSyA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T07:22:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":