","html_url":"https://github.com/romain-pm","id":14941167,"login":"romain-pm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTQxMTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romain-pm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/quick-find/commits/278dc86ddf1abb0e271da009af333ff9d02365d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:51:21Z","email":"contact@romain.pm","name":"Romain Gauthier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:51:21Z","email":"contact@romain.pm","name":"Romain Gauthier"},"message":"chore: add the MIT licence\n\nThe repository had no LICENSE file, so nothing stated the terms the code is\npublished under. GitHub reported no licence at all.\n\nMIT, matching the rest of the Jahia module estate. The copyright line follows\nJahia/content-review, the closest comparator — a public, MIT, product-team\njContent UI-extension module created in 2026 — and the holder string that\nCortex''s own jahia-repo-config guidelines specify. A single year rather than a\nrange: this code''s history starts in 2026, so the \"2002 - <year>\" line other\nJahia repos carry, inherited from the original product codebase, would be\nfiction here.\n\nAlso declares the licence where tooling looks for it: a <licenses> block in the\nPOM, a \"license\" field in package.json, and a section in the README.\n\nNo per-file headers: Jahia dropped that requirement and the root LICENSE is the\nlicence of record.","tree":{"sha":"57a5d5b0a8f8f2800ef6461ec800be881c5d1222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/quick-find/git/trees/57a5d5b0a8f8f2800ef6461ec800be881c5d1222"},"url":"ht