name":"Romain Gauthier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T20:57:44Z","email":"contact@romain.pm","name":"Romain Gauthier"},"message":"fix(tests): fix e2e test infrastructure and add missing specs\n\n- Fix openSearchModal: use .moonstone-primaryNavItem click instead of Ctrl+K\n  (keyboard events don''t reach jContent''s iframe)\n- Fix input selector: input[type=''search''] (moonstone spreads props, overrides hardcoded type=''text'')\n- Replace cy.apollo/addNode with custom gqlRequest using cy.request + Origin header\n  (cross-fetch doesn''t send Origin; Jahia CSRF policy blocks requests without it)\n- Fix kfind-test-module repository.xml: moduleType=''templatesSet'' with proper\n  templates folder and home page (was ''module'', causing sites with no home)\n- Fix jnt:page creation: add mandatory j:templateName property\n- Fix kfindtest:mainResource parent: use /home (jnt:page) not /contents/kfind-main-resources\n  (jnt:contentFolder does not allow kfindtest:mainResource children)\n- Fix jnt:file creation: multipart GraphQL upload with proper jcr:data binary\n  (filed content derived from filename for full-text searchability)\n- Fix ensureMediaRoot: use jnt:folder (jnt:file requires jnt:folder parent, not jnt:contentFolder)\n- Fix JCR search queries: add like on j:nodename with vSearchTerm variable for\n  hyphenated filename matching; fix quoted variable references ('''' -> $vSearchTerm)\n- Add missing e2e specs: kfindEdgeCases, kfindInteraction, kfindMainResources, kfindPagination\n- Add kfindtest:mainResource CND definition to jahia-module\n\n17/19 tests passing (kfindFeatures ''no results'' text + kfindInteraction ArrowDown still open)","tree":{"sha":"79515a41f734f3a841c367e37318f88b3a5b43a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/quick-find/git/trees/79515a41f734f3a841c367e37318f88b3a5b43a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/quick-find/git/commits/492a1fa89fa3171b17b308cae87585200b227711","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigne