ists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BackSua","id":119374802,"login":"BackSua","node_id":"U_kgDOBx2D0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdtovar07/MSPI_NVA_CO_DOCS/commits/5a3cf513f0da9ee2334448ec1d2a4281fefef074/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T22:13:28Z","email":"baironsuarez1205@gmail.com","name":"BaironSuarez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T22:13:28Z","email":"baironsuarez1205@gmail.com","name":"BaironSuarez"},"message":"docs: agregar documentación complementaria y actualizar MER a DBML real\n\n- MER-MSPI.dbml: modelo entidad-relación completo en DBML, generado 1:1 a\n  partir del DDL real y ejecutado (postgres/init/MER-MSPI.sql), incluyendo\n  las tablas y columnas añadidas en el trabajo de RBAC/catálogo/IAM\n  (catalog.scale, catalog.scale_version, catalog.question_bank,\n  catalog.question_bank_question, iam.login_attempt, iam.notification,\n  iam.system_config, iam.system_config_history, y los campos prepared_by/\n  auditor_id/auditor_display_name en assessment.assessment), con todas las\n  relaciones (ref:) tomadas de las FK reales declaradas en el esquema.\n- 04-Decisiones-Tecnicas-Complementarias.md: RBAC de dos niveles en\n  ms_assessment, auditorId como texto libre, manejo de errores uniforme,\n  bloqueo de cuenta, búsqueda de preguntas vía SQL nativo, outputHashing +\n  Cache-Control, integración de microfrontends vía iframe.\n- 05-Manual-Despliegue.md: guía paso a paso para levantar el stack completo\n  en Docker.\n- 06-Guia-Pruebas-Funcionales.md: secuencia de flujos end-to-end para\n  demostrar el sistema (login/2FA, panel admin, organizaciones, catálogo,\n  ciclo completo de evaluación, evidencia, diagnóstico y reportes).\n- 07-Manual-Usuario.md: manual de usuario final con guía específica por rol.\n- 08-Referencia-API.md: índice consolidado de la API de los 6 microservicios.\n- Índice general y README actualizados con los nuevos documentos.","tree":{"sha":"f8962b8a9442a2bf9328322e0c44a7bd4131cb39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdtovar07/MSPI_NVA_CO_DOCS/git/trees/f8962b8a9442a2bf9328322e0c44a7bd4131cb39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdtovar07/MSPI_NVA_CO_DOCS/git/commits/5a3cf513f0da9ee2334448ec1d2a4281fefef074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119374802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BackSua","id":119374802,"login":"BackSua","node_id":"U_kgDOBx2D0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdtovar07/MSPI_NVA_CO_DOCS/commit/5a3cf513f0da9ee2334448ec1d2a4281fefef074","node_id":"C_kwDOULcqq9oAKDVhM2NmNTEzZjBkYTllZTIzMzQ0NDhlYzFkMmE0MjgxZmVmZWYwNzQ","parents":[{"html_