subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafliiar17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafliiar17/buanasphere/commits/ee9a63df671e106db6d2dcf87e24f33bc1e85965/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:44:19Z","email":"39895896+rafliiar17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"IamRFZ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:44:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(nature): implement Nature World (/nature) 3D globe micro-app (#23)\n\n* feat(routing): implement path-based micro-app routing and custom domains (globe.arafz.id & api-globe.arafz.id)\n\n- Router: Implement Svelte 5 reactive GeoGlobe path router with HTML5 pushState & popstate history sync\n- Micro-Apps: Route / and /kurs to Kurs World, /time to TimeWorld, /flight to Flow Corridors, and /passport to Passport World\n- Backend CORS: Update isAllowedCorsOrigin allowlist for globe.arafz.id, api-globe.arafz.id, and subdomains\n- Worker Config: Add custom domain route api-globe.arafz.id/* in backend/wrangler.jsonc\n- Pages Functions: Update API proxy fallback to https://api-globe.arafz.id\n- UI: Add path pills in GeoAppLauncherModal\n- Tests: Add path-routing.test.ts and domain-cors.test.ts (259/259 tests passing)\n- Docs: Publish ADR 0028 and SDLC verification report 0028\n\n* fix(branding): make splash screen, navbar, and page title dynamically adapt to active micro-app route\n\n- Splash: Bind wordmark, tagline, and telemetry step dynamically to geoStore.activeApp (e.g. Time.World on /time)\n- Navbar: Render dynamic app wordmark and interactive app switcher button linked to canonical path\n- Head Title: Dynamically update browser document title based on active micro-app\n- Status Pill: Display active app name in top-left live pill of WorldRateMap\n- Tests: Add dynamic-app-branding.test.ts (263/263 unit tests passing)\n- Docs: Publish ADR 0029 and SDLC verification report 0029\n\n* feat(microapps): isolate controls, tooltips, bottom docks, and 3D visual layers for each micro-app\n\n- Micro-App Modules: Created isolated modules in frontend/src/lib/apps/{kurs,time,flight,passport}\n- TimeWorld (/time): Added TimeControls (working hours filter, daylight mode, 24h format), TimeTooltip (local digital time, daylight status, WIB diff), TimeBottomDock (financial hubs clock ticker)\n- Flow Corridors (/flight): Added FlightControls (corridor filters, particle speed), FlightTooltip (annual volume, migrant workers, fee), FlightBottomDock (top 8 remittance hubs ticker)\n- Passport World (/passport): Added PassportControls (WNI visa status filter, mobility rank), PassportTooltip (passport rank, visa-free count), PassportBottomDock (global passport ranking ticker)\n- Kurs World (/kurs): Added KursControls (quick currency converter, spot rate/change/flag metrics), KursTooltip, KursBottomDock\n- Map & Globe 3D: Dynamic shader coloring (Daylight Amber/Navy, 3D Arcs to Jakarta, Visa mobility heatmap) and dynamic component delegation in WorldRateMap\n- Tests: Added isolated-microapp-modules.test.ts (268/268 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0030 and SDLC verification report 0030\n\n* feat(filter): implement two-way reactive filtering integration across 3D globe and micro-apps\n\n- Filter Engine: Created filterEngine.ts with time, flight corridor, and passport visa matching predicates\n- Reactive GeoStore: Added timeFilter, flightCorridorFilter, passportVisaFilter states and isCountryMatched helper\n- TimeControls (/time): Connected office hours (09:00-17:00), daylight, and night filters directly to geoStore\n- FlightControls (/flight): Connected corridor region filters (Middle East, ASEAN, East Asia, West) to 3D arc slicing and automatic camera flyTo\n- PassportControls (/passport): Connected Indonesian visa requirement filters (Visa Free, VoA, Visa Required) to country highlights\n- Globe3DView: Implemented dynamic country dimming (translucent alpha), polygon 3D elevation (0.008 vs 0.001), and 3D arc filtering\n- Tests: Added microapp-filtering-integration.test.ts (273/273 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0031 and SDLC verification report 0031\n\n* chore(domain): configure production domains globe.arafz.id and api-globe.arafz.id\n\n- Backend: Added api-globe.arafz.id/* custom domain route in wrangler.jsonc\n- Pages Function: Configured fallback proxy to https://api-globe.arafz.id\n- CI/CD Workflow: Updated deploy.yml job descriptions for globe.arafz.id and api-globe.arafz.id\n\n* chore(security): update CSP headers to allow Google Fonts and Cloudflare Insights\n\n* fix(navbar): align navbar wordmark link to active micro-app canonical path\n\n* feat(map): implement smooth metric switching (flag/rate/trend) with non-blocking lazy-loading HUD\n\n- Globe3DView: Implemented applyMetricTransition pipeline with GeoJSON shallow cloning to clean up and rebind Three.js polygonCapMaterial\n- Lazy-Loading HUD: Added holographic loading HUD overlay with dynamic message resolution and animated spinner\n- Navbar: Fixed container max-width to 1536px (max-w-8xl) per ADR-0026\n- Tests: Added metric-switching-and-lazyloading.test.ts (277/277 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0032 and SDLC verification report 0032\n\n* fix(map): calibrate high-contrast bullish/bearish heatmap for 24h trend metric\n\n* fix(map): refine procedural flag spherical coordinates and cap material assignment\n\n* fix(adr0033): system diagnostics remediation — cache TTL, KV expiration, micro-rate precision, D1 batching, spike detection, Svelte 5 effect safety, WebGL disposal\n\n* fix(mapstate): convert MapState to Svelte 5 reactive class with $state runes — fix metric filter indicator not switching visually\n\n* feat(nature): implement Nature World (/nature) 3D globe micro-app with 195+ biodiversity dataset\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rafliiar17 <rafztesting@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"91041b8550440d4b86010cf43ec7b6a207483e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafliiar17/buanasphere/git/trees/91041b8550440d4b86010cf43ec7b6a207483e8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafliiar17/buanasphere/git/commits/ee9a63df671e106db6d2dcf87e24f33bc1e85965","verification":{"payload":"tree 91041b8550440d4b86010cf43ec7b6a207483e8a\nparent ca2a57a8a052cb4a8ebc85d7884cb936a75fe117\nauthor IamRFZ <39895896+rafliiar17@users.noreply.github.com> 1788345859 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788345859 +0700\n\nfeat(nature): implement Nature World (/nature) 3D globe micro-app (#23)\n\n* feat(routing): implement path-based micro-app routing and custom domains (globe.arafz.id & api-globe.arafz.id)\n\n- Router: Implement Svelte 5 reactive GeoGlobe path router with HTML5 pushState & popstate history sync\n- Micro-Apps: Route / and /kurs to Kurs World, /time to TimeWorld, /flight to Flow Corridors, and /passport to Passport World\n- Backend CORS: Update isAllowedCorsOrigin allowlist for globe.arafz.id, api-globe.arafz.id, and subdomains\n- Worker Config: Add custom domain route api-globe.arafz.id/* in backend/wrangler.jsonc\n- Pages Functions: Update API proxy fallback to https://api-globe.arafz.id\n- UI: Add path pills in GeoAppLauncherModal\n- Tests: Add path-routing.test.ts and domain-cors.test.ts (259/259 tests passing)\n- Docs: Publish ADR 0028 and SDLC verification report 0028\n\n* fix(branding): make splash screen, navbar, and page title dynamically adapt to active micro-app route\n\n- Splash: Bind wordmark, tagline, and telemetry step dynamically to geoStore.activeApp (e.g. Time.World on /time)\n- Navbar: Render dynamic app wordmark and interactive app switcher button linked to canonical path\n- Head Title: Dynamically update browser document title based on active micro-app\n- Status Pill: Display active app name in top-left live pill of WorldRateMap\n- Tests: Add dynamic-app-branding.test.ts (263/263 unit tests passing)\n- Docs: Publish ADR 0029 and SDLC verification report 0029\n\n* feat(microapps): isolate controls, tooltips, bottom docks, and 3D visual layers for each micro-app\n\n- Micro-App Modules: Created isolated modules in frontend/src/lib/apps/{kurs,time,flight,passport}\n- TimeWorld (/time): Added TimeControls (working hours filter, daylight mode, 24h format), TimeTooltip (local digital time, daylight status, WIB diff), TimeBottomDock (financial hubs clock ticker)\n- Flow Corridors (/flight): Added FlightControls (corridor filters, particle speed), FlightTooltip (annual volume, migrant workers, fee), FlightBottomDock (top 8 remittance hubs ticker)\n- Passport World (/passport): Added PassportControls (WNI visa status filter, mobility rank), PassportTooltip (passport rank, visa-free count), PassportBottomDock (global passport ranking ticker)\n- Kurs World (/kurs): Added KursControls (quick currency converter, spot rate/change/flag metrics), KursTooltip, KursBottomDock\n- Map & Globe 3D: Dynamic shader coloring (Daylight Amber/Navy, 3D Arcs to Jakarta, Visa mobility heatmap) and dynamic component delegation in WorldRateMap\n- Tests: Added isolated-microapp-modules.test.ts (268/268 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0030 and SDLC verification report 0030\n\n* feat(filter): implement two-way reactive filtering integration across 3D globe and micro-apps\n\n- Filter Engine: Created filterEngine.ts with time, flight corridor, and passport visa matching predicates\n- Reactive GeoStore: Added timeFilter, flightCorridorFilter, passportVisaFilter states and isCountryMatched helper\n- TimeControls (/time): Connected office hours (09:00-17:00), daylight, and night filters directly to geoStore\n- FlightControls (/flight): Connected corridor region filters (Middle East, ASEAN, East Asia, West) to 3D arc slicing and automatic camera flyTo\n- PassportControls (/passport): Connected Indonesian visa requirement filters (Visa Free, VoA, Visa Required) to country highlights\n- Globe3DView: Implemented dynamic country dimming (translucent alpha), polygon 3D elevation (0.008 vs 0.001), and 3D arc filtering\n- Tests: Added microapp-filtering-integration.test.ts (273/273 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0031 and SDLC verification report 0031\n\n* chore(domain): configure production domains globe.arafz.id and api-globe.arafz.id\n\n- Backend: Added api-globe.arafz.id/* custom domain route in wrangler.jsonc\n- Pages Function: Configured fallback proxy to https://api-globe.arafz.id\n- CI/CD Workflow: Updated deploy.yml job descriptions for globe.arafz.id and api-globe.arafz.id\n\n* chore(security): update CSP headers to allow Google Fonts and Cloudflare Insights\n\n* fix(navbar): align navbar wordmark link to active micro-app canonical path\n\n* feat(map): implement smooth metric switching (flag/rate/trend) with non-blocking lazy-loading HUD\n\n- Globe3DView: Implemented applyMetricTransition pipeline with GeoJSON shallow cloning to clean up and rebind Three.js polygonCapMaterial\n- Lazy-Loading HUD: Added holographic loading HUD overlay with dynamic message resolution and animated spinner\n- Navbar: Fixed container max-width to 1536px (max-w-8xl) per ADR-0026\n- Tests: Added metric-switching-and-lazyloading.test.ts (277/277 tests passing)\n- Docs: Published ADR 0032 and SDLC verification report 0032\n\n* fix(map): calibrate high-contrast bullish/bearish heatmap for 24h trend metric\n\n* fix(map): refine procedural flag spherical coordinates and cap material assignment\n\n* fix(adr0033): system diagnostics remediation — cache TTL, KV expiration, micro-rate precision, D1 batching, spike detection, Svelte 5 effect safety, WebGL disposal\n\n* fix(mapstate): convert MapState to Svelte 5 reactive class with $state runes — fix metric filter indicator not switching visually\n\n* feat(nature): implement Nature World (/nature) 3D globe micro-app with 195+ biodiversity dataset\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rafliiar17 <rafztesting@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql/4DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHJQQAFXaN76O2i55f5SZ4NdXa7U3\naJtyCvzqZX46