,"email":"benoit.goethals@gmail.com","name":"benoit"},"message":"Hotel reservation desk: clean architecture over PostgreSQL, Avalonia micro-frontends\n\nDomain, Application, Infrastructure and Presentation are separate projects with\ndependencies pointing inwards only. The domain owns the booking rules (half-open\nstay periods, the reservation state machine, capacity and pricing policies) and\nhas no dependencies at all.\n\nPersistence is EF Core over PostgreSQL behind repository ports. Double-booking is\nrefused twice: by RoomAvailabilityService before the write, and by a gist exclusion\nconstraint on (room_id, daterange) that closes the read-then-write race. The\nadapter translates the constraint violation into a domain exception so Npgsql\nnever reaches the application layer.\n\nThe presentation layer is split into four feature modules - Booking, Reservations,\nRooms and Guests - each built into its own assembly and discovered at run time.\nThe shell holds no compile-time reference to any of them and they coordinate only\nthrough published events on IFeatureEventBus.\n\n62 unit tests cover the domain rules, the use cases and the event bus, using\nin-memory ports so no database is needed.\n\nCredentials are not committed: appsettings.json carries a placeholder, overridden\nby the git-ignored appsettings.Local.json or by the environment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"300411fa6b23bf07787eaa7a1af8c416362ee043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenoitGoethals/hotel-reservation/git/trees/300411fa6b23bf07787eaa7a1af8c416362ee043"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenoitGoethals/hotel-reservation/git/commits/0c4f993ee8e65b9ace8c80eb91d640319c3e8b76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1076279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenoitGoethals","id":1076279,"login":"BenoitGoethals","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzYyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenoitGoethals","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenoitGoethals/hotel-reservation/commit/0c4f993ee8e65b9ace8c80eb91d640319c3e8b76","node_id":"C_kwDOULtD8NoAKDBjNGY5OTNlZThlNjViOWFjZThjODBlYjkxZDY0MDMxOWMzZThiNzY","parents":[],"sha":"0c4f993ee8e65b9ace8c80eb91d640319c3e8b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenoitGoethals/hotel-reservation/commits/0c4f993ee8e65b9ace8c80eb91d640319c3e8b76"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenoitGoethals/hotel-reservation/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=0c4f993ee8e65b9ace8c80eb91d640319c3e8b76&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A26.560Z"}');
