ml_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/0e8da00541f226f96f71566ccc882448be09a4d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:15:42Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:15:42Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"message":"Add MCP tools: project_skills_list, project_skills_get\n\nNode ESM module (mcp/, matching paca-plugin-example''s mcp/ layout and\nbuild config exactly) loaded dynamically by Paca''s MCP server. Both\ntools wrap this plugin''s existing HTTP routes via PluginAPIClient — no\nbackend changes needed.\n\nVerified against a real running instance by driving the actual\napps/mcp server binary over stdio with real JSON-RPC initialize/\ntools/call messages (not a direct function-call shortcut): the server\nlogged \"Loaded com.gorlix.project-skills (2 tool(s))\", and both tools\nreturned real data — project_skills_get''s SKILL.md output matched\nbyte-for-byte the same skill''s content already verified via curl in\nan earlier commit.\n\nAlso updates the README''s API/Structure/Future-work sections, which\nhad drifted out of date across the last several commits (still\ndescribing the pre-doc-linking `body` field, no mention of the\nfrontend or this MCP module).","tree":{"sha":"e73b29aa56d46c4f2ac650ec4c49190e03c158b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/trees/e73b29aa56d46c4f2ac650ec4c49190e03c158b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/commits/0e8da00541f226f96f71566ccc882448be09a4d0","verification":{"payload":"tree e73b29aa56d46c4f2ac650ec4c49190e03c158b3\nparent 8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2\nauthor Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788376542 +0200\ncommitter Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788376542 +0200\n\nAdd MCP tools: project_skills_list, project_skills_get\n\nNode ESM module (mcp/, matching paca-plugin-example''s mcp/ layout and\nbuild config exactly) loaded dynamically by Paca''s MCP server. Both\ntools wrap this plugin''s existing HTTP routes via PluginAPIClient — no\nbackend changes needed.\n\nVerified against a real running instance by driving the actual\napps/mcp server binary over stdio with real JSON-RPC initialize/\ntools/call messages (not a direct function-call shortcut): the server\nlogged \"Loaded com.gorlix.project-skills (2 tool(s))\", and both tools\nreturned real data — project_skills_get''s SKILL.md output matched\nbyte-for-byte the same skill''s content already verified via curl in\nan earlier commit.\n\nAlso updates the README''s API/Structure/Future-work sections, which\nhad drifted out of date across the last several commits (still\ndescribing the pre-doc-linking `body` field, no mention of the\nfrontend or this MCP module).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg0majsr8Y1gmdE0fdlZTRZibVDa\n7zMfK5NNR8NIyhokwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQON8KfLtBMmOgTYrvm9kyR2VTWZAZm6LME8qQ0DntiONKIwHAhQdZIQ29NUX06l0yy\nAHh3MpsXFHMbbBs+aQPw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T19:15:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us