vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:50:48Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:50:48Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"message":"Bump version to 0.2.0\n\nReflects the doc-linked skill body model and the new frontend\n(sidebar section + metadata page) added in the prior two commits —\nboth are breaking changes to the plugin''s own schema and API contract\n(POST/PATCH now take doc_id, not body).","tree":{"sha":"4d8c0b0628fdfcdafd08cfcfc7a3f18e9336ab28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/trees/4d8c0b0628fdfcdafd08cfcfc7a3f18e9336ab28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/commits/8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d8c0b0628fdfcdafd08cfcfc7a3f18e9336ab28\nparent 2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea\nauthor Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788375048 +0200\ncommitter Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788375048 +0200\n\nBump version to 0.2.0\n\nReflects the doc-linked skill body model and the new frontend\n(sidebar section + metadata page) added in the prior two commits —\nboth are breaking changes to the plugin''s own schema and API contract\n(POST/PATCH now take doc_id, not body).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg0majsr8Y1gmdE0fdlZTRZibVDa\n7zMfK5NNR8NIyhokwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBxSBC0BnzfTQRubMMtQPd+pA+6UCZ0q3hYXj2SyPlzr7nIyeEp9nAvNosp07VIpKn\nwhRFN+UzArqTlIIkprqA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T18:50:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commit/8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2","node_id":"C_kwDOUL-hxtoAKDhlZDdlYzIyMTA1ZDNkMTM5YjRhMDBlYjcyNTEwNjUwMGZjOWRhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commit/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea","sha":"2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea"}],"sha":"8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/8ed7ec22105d3d139b4a00eb725106500fc9daa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:45:31Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:45:52Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"message":"Add project frontend: sidebar tree + metadata page, no custom editor\n\nReact micro-frontend (Module Federation via @module-federation/vite,\nmatching the host loader''s actual runtime rather than\n@originjs/vite-plugin-federation) exposing two components:\n\n- ProjectSkillsSidebarSection (sidebar.project.section): a skill tree\n  matching the Documentation section''s own look — folder rows, \"...\"\n  menu, \"+ Add\" — built with plain inline styles + the host''s real\n  --sidebar-* CSS custom properties, since the host''s shadcn sidebar\n  components aren''t reachable from an isolated federated bundle. It\n  calls the plugin API directly (usePluginQuery/api.pluginGet) to\n  list skills.\n\n- ProjectSkillsPage (project.page, hidden from the auto-generated\n  Plugins nav since the sidebar section already provides navigation):\n  a small name/description/triggers form plus an \"Open SKILL.md\"\n  button. No BlockNote here — the body is a real Document (see the\n  backend commit), so creating a skill calls the host''s own\n  `/api/v1/projects/:id/docs` endpoint directly (same one its own UI\n  uses) to create it, files it under an auto-created \"Skills\" doc\n  folder so it doesn''t read as an ordinary document, and navigates\n  straight into the host''s native Documentation editor.\n\nreact/react-dom are pinned to the exact version the host runs\n(19.2.5, not ^19.0.0) — a patch-version mismatch made Module\nFederation''s singleton sharing fall back to bundling a second\nreact-dom instead of reusing the host''s, crashing on mount with React\nerror #527.\n\nREQUIRES an unreleased host fix: the sidebar.project.section\nextension point doesn''t receive api/ui/meta props at all on stock\nPaca-AI/paca today — app-sidebar.tsx passes it only `{ projectId }`,\nunlike project.page''s route (which builds real props via\nusePluginBaseProps). Without that fix, ProjectSkillsSidebarSection''s\nown api.pluginGet call throws on mount (api is undefined) and the\nsection silently renders empty. Confirmed against a local checkout by\npatching app-sidebar.tsx to inject the same usePluginBaseProps result\nproject.page gets — not yet upstreamed. Until Paca-AI/paca ships that\nfix (or an equivalent), this plugin''s sidebar section won''t populate\non an unpatched instance; the marketplace listing should call this\nout as a version requirement once merged.","tree":{"sha":"e2238ce1e4680d6b0001195dea5d79e2c06ae647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/trees/e2238ce1e4680d6b0001195dea5d79e2c06ae647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/commits/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea","verification":{"payload":"tree e2238ce1e4680d6b0001195dea5d79e2c06ae647\nparent ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598\nauthor Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788374731 +0200\ncommitter Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788374752 +0200\n\nAdd project frontend: sidebar tree + metadata page, no custom editor\n\nReact micro-frontend (Module Federation via @module-federation/vite,\nmatching the host loader''s actual runtime rather than\n@originjs/vite-plugin-federation) exposing two components:\n\n- ProjectSkillsSidebarSection (sidebar.project.section): a skill tree\n  matching the Documentation section''s own look — folder rows, \"...\"\n  menu, \"+ Add\" — built with plain inline styles + the host''s real\n  --sidebar-* CSS custom properties, since the host''s shadcn sidebar\n  components aren''t reachable from an isolated federated bundle. It\n  calls the plugin API directly (usePluginQuery/api.pluginGet) to\n  list skills.\n\n- ProjectSkillsPage (project.page, hidden from the auto-generated\n  Plugins nav since the sidebar section already provides navigation):\n  a small name/description/triggers form plus an \"Open SKILL.md\"\n  button. No BlockNote here — the body is a real Document (see the\n  backend commit), so creating a skill calls the host''s own\n  `/api/v1/projects/:id/docs` endpoint directly (same one its own UI\n  uses) to create it, files it under an auto-created \"Skills\" doc\n  folder so it doesn''t read as an ordinary document, and navigates\n  straight into the host''s native Documentation editor.\n\nreact/react-dom are pinned to the exact version the host runs\n(19.2.5, not ^19.0.0) — a patch-version mismatch made Module\nFederation''s singleton sharing fall back to bundling a second\nreact-dom instead of reusing the host''s, crashing on mount with React\nerror #527.\n\nREQUIRES an unreleased host fix: the sidebar.project.section\nextension point doesn''t receive api/ui/meta props at all on stock\nPaca-AI/paca today — app-sidebar.tsx passes it only `{ projectId }`,\nunlike project.page''s route (which builds real props via\nusePluginBaseProps). Without that fix, ProjectSkillsSidebarSection''s\nown api.pluginGet call throws on mount (api is undefined) and the\nsection silently renders empty. Confirmed against a local checkout by\npatching app-sidebar.tsx to inject the same usePluginBaseProps result\nproject.page gets — not yet upstreamed. Until Paca-AI/paca ships that\nfix (or an equivalent), this plugin''s sidebar section won''t populate\non an unpatched instance; the marketplace listing should call this\nout as a version requirement once merged.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg0majsr8Y1gmdE0fdlZTRZibVDa\n7zMfK5NNR8NIyhokwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDg4+gFfjp0c45tfdLSibB5BpiXZPJalWpNouYy8jz9+q/9UcE+GsbUp5dr9w4njAS\nFgNr7mmnH/tYGenYC0yw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T18:49:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commit/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea","node_id":"C_kwDOUL-hxtoAKDJhZjE3MDZmZWVmY2FmOGUxYjc4NTZkNTdmNDIxYjQxZTJmMjUyZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commit/ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598","sha":"ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598"}],"sha":"2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/2af1706feefcaf8e1b7856d57f421b41e2f252ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/commits/ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:45:08Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:45:08Z","email":"ale.gorla2002@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Gorla"},"message":"Link skills to real project Documents instead of storing body text\n\nA skill''s instructions now live in an actual Documentation entry\n(BlockNote content, same as any other project doc) rather than a\nplain TEXT column this plugin owned outright — editing a skill''s body\nreuses the host''s own Documentation editor instead of this plugin\nbuilding a second one.\n\nproject_skills.body is dropped in favor of doc_id (migration 0003).\nGET /skills/:name now does a read-only lookup into the host''s own\n`documents` table (its `content` column has no declared-sensitive\nfields, so an unqualified SELECT is permitted for plugin backends —\nsee coreSensitiveFields in the host''s plugin runtime) and converts the\nstored BlockNote block JSON to markdown (backend/markdown.go) to\nrender the full SKILL.md this plugin serves to external agent clients.\nPOST now takes doc_id instead of body, validated against that same\ntable so it can''t be pointed at another project''s document.\n\nAlso commits migration 0002 (project_skill_files), added in an\nearlier session but never actually committed — that table isn''t wired\nto any handler yet; multi-file skill support (scripts/, references/)\nis still open, see the project''s own notes on doc-attachment storage.","tree":{"sha":"c12225a40de7b9037471555bfc015661a0775c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/trees/c12225a40de7b9037471555bfc015661a0775c58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gorlix/paca-plugin-project-skills/git/commits/ba1e8122483c4324dffdd82556a1f0d02f76b598","verification":{"payload":"tree c12225a40de7b9037471555bfc015661a0775c58\nparent 6798efa3477bc9e15a31a56b7039e946a765fcfc\nauthor Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788374708 +0200\ncommitter Alessandro Gorla <ale.gorla2002@gmail.com> 1788374708 +0200\n\nLink skills to real project Documents instead of storing body text\n\nA skill''s instructions now live in an actual Documentation entry\n(BlockNote content, same as any other project doc) rather than a\nplain TEXT column this plugin owned outright — editing a skill''s body\nreuses the host''s own Documentation editor instead of this plugin\nbuilding a second one.\n\nproject_skills.body is dropped in favor of doc_id (migration 0003).\nGET /skills/:name now does a read-only lookup into the host''s own\n`documents` table (its `content` column has no declared-sensitive\nfields, so an unqualified SELECT is permitted for plugin backends —\nsee coreSensitiveFields in the host''s plugin runtime) and converts the\nstored BlockNote block JSON to markdown (backend/markdown.go) to\nrender the full SKILL.md this plugin serves to external agent clients.\nPOST now takes doc_id instead of body, validated against that same\ntable so it can''t be pointed at another project''s document.\n\nAlso commits migration 0002 (project_skill_files), added in an\nearlier session but never actually committed — that table isn''t wired\nto any handler yet; multi-file skill support (scripts/, references/)\nis still open, see the project''s own notes on doc-attachment storage.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg0majsr8Y1gmdE0fdlZTRZibVDa\n7zMfK5NNR8NIyhokwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAvszUWMOhZEA7MFwFG39zp3F/14BP+sHaVjd70+Y8qEwYm3PYrEahxdiLU05Sa1s2\noiUd4sK2M57/MG4R2+wAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T18:49:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39005603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gorlix","id":39005603,"login":"gorlix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA1NjAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gorlix/subscriptions","type":"User",