r/git/trees/8d17ce3df9bed0b74d1a6fd666cb5ea219812091"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/commits/c7f91109821eca1952bad67820bfbc5ed8beedd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commit/c7f91109821eca1952bad67820bfbc5ed8beedd9","node_id":"C_kwDOUMIpT9oAKGM3ZjkxMTA5ODIxZWNhMTk1MmJhZDY3ODIwYmZiYzVlZDhiZWVkZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commit/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd","sha":"1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd"}],"sha":"c7f91109821eca1952bad67820bfbc5ed8beedd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/c7f91109821eca1952bad67820bfbc5ed8beedd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:50:59Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:50:59Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"message":"feat(ciudad): filtered city status view, with free-tier cost fixes\n\nAdds the listing half of /ciudad: three headline stats (unresolved, this\nweek, age of the oldest open issue) and four filter groups — state,\nperiod, sort and category — over a map and a list.\n\nFilters live in the URL rather than React state, so views are shareable\nand bookmarkable, the back button works, the page stays a server\ncomponent, and filtering works with JavaScript off. \"Los huecos sin\nresolver más antiguos\" is a link you can send someone, which for an app\nwhose point is public pressure may matter more than the filters.\n\nTwo changes to stay inside the free tier:\n\n- Thumbnails are generated client-side and stored as data URIs in\n  Postgres, not Blob. Lists, popups and the duplicate prompt read those,\n  so browsing costs no Blob data transfer — trading the abundant\n  resource (0.5 GB of Postgres) for the scarce one (10 GB/month of Blob\n  transfer). Size-capped at 24 KB and enforced server side, since the\n  column would otherwise be a cheap way to fill the database.\n\n- /ciudad''s queries are cached for 60s, tagged, and busted by the report\n  and confirm actions so a reporter sees their own pin immediately. The\n  cache sits on the data, not the page: reading searchParams forces\n  dynamic rendering regardless of revalidate. Neon''s free allowance is\n  compute-hours, so collapsing page views into one query per minute is\n  what keeps the database asleep.","tree":{"sha":"fff5a33acd6dc6a9047108252aefdc93686c3df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/trees/fff5a33acd6dc6a9047108252aefdc93686c3df9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/commits/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commit/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd","node_id":"C_kwDOUMIpT9oAKDFhNmY0Y2I1ZWY5MjgwZDdhMWE1NWI1MTYwZjczYmZlYTdlMjAwY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commit/d1a41d42ef02704f8ebc81043c2845549cf2b989","sha":"d1a41d42ef02704f8ebc81043c2845549cf2b989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/d1a41d42ef02704f8ebc81043c2845549cf2b989"}],"sha":"1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/1a6f4cb5ef9280d7a1a55b5160f73bfea7e200cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/d1a41d42ef02704f8ebc81043c2845549cf2b989/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:25:34Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:25:34Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"message":"feat(report): mobile report flow with duplicate confirmation\n\nLanding page with the two primary actions, then a four-step report flow:\nphoto (camera or gallery, resized client-side, uploaded direct to Blob),\ndescription and category, GPS location with a draggable correction pin.\n\nAnti-abuse is dedupe-and-confirm rather than rejection: a report landing\nwithin a per-category radius of a live issue offers to confirm that issue\ninstead, which turns duplicate pressure into a priority signal. Radii are\n20/60/30 m for potholes, traffic lights and street lighting — sized to the\nobjects rather than one flat distance. Matching is against open issues\nregardless of age, so long-running problems keep absorbing duplicates.\n\nConfirmations are unique per device per day, so repeat sightings act as a\nfreshness signal alongside created_at for duration.\n\nAlso: geofence to Cali, photo required, hashed device key capped at 10/day\nwith a soft review threshold at 5, honeypot and minimum form time.\n\nDrops the microfrontend plan — single app.","tree":{"sha":"d35e97d9c20145894bbc05104cce46dc82762096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/trees/d35e97d9c20145894bbc05104cce46dc82762096"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/commits/d1a41d42ef02704f8ebc81043c2845549cf2b989","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://ap