com/users/LuisMontana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/commits/4df67504e87f2113b94f6da65139332dbea90077/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:42:59Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:42:59Z","email":"lmontana@live.com","name":"Luis-Montana"},"message":"feat(map): self-host basemap from a 4.4 MB Protomaps extract\n\nReplaces OpenStreetMap raster tiles with a vector .pmtiles extract of\nCali served from public/. No API key, no rate limit, no third-party tile\nhost in the request path. Spanish labels via the basemaps `lang` option.\n\nmaplibre-gl pinned to v5 — see Known constraints in the README.","tree":{"sha":"a2933d2928d3688093388af5759a3ab34c098a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/trees/a2933d2928d3688093388af5759a3ab34c098a6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuisMontana/city-tracker/git/commits/4df67504e87f2113b94f6da65139332dbea90077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5395516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMontana","id":5395516,"login":"LuisMontana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTU1MTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co