","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/eafb8eb01cf02f6b49d0b99376443fa506d39c61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:28:26Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:28:26Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"message":"Add Docker Compose deployment behind Nginx, and the README\n\n- docker-compose.yml wiring Postgres, Gunicorn and Nginx, with media and\n  static on shared volumes and a healthcheck gating the backend start.\n- backend Dockerfile plus an entrypoint that waits for Postgres, migrates,\n  collects static files and optionally seeds demo data.\n- frontend Dockerfile building the SPA into the Nginx image, so one\n  origin serves the app and proxies /api, /media and /static.\n- STATIC_URL and MEDIA_URL made root-relative: as relative paths the\n  attachment URLs resolved against the request path, which breaks once\n  the app is served behind a proxy on nested routes.\n- README covering how to run it, the data model, assumptions and\n  trade-offs, with screenshots of the running app.","tree":{"sha":"3b162c9973556c6292569b9738aa2fbfa1cceacd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/trees/3b162c9973556c6292569b9738aa2fbfa1cceacd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/commits/eafb8eb01cf02f6b49d0b99376443fa506d39c61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58877698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commit/eafb8eb01cf02f6b49d0b99376443fa506d39c61","node_id":"C_kwDOUMJTnNoAKGVhZmI4ZWIwMWNmMDJmNmI0OWQwYjk5Mzc2NDQzZmE1MDZkMzljNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commit/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f","sha":"0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f"}],"sha":"eafb8eb01cf02f6b49d0b99376443fa506d39c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/eafb8eb01cf02f6b49d0b99376443fa506d39c61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58877698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:21:22Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:21:22Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"message":"Add Vue 3 SPA: customer panel and support console\n\nTwo registers over one shared design system (tokens, 3px borders, hard\nshadows, single accent), so the two audiences read differently without\nbecoming two products:\n\n- customer panel: editorial serif, order list with a vertical status\n  rail, and a ticket form that switches on order status — photos plus a\n  description when delivered, driver details when shipped, free text\n  otherwise.\n- support console: dark monospace queue with an SLA lamp per row,\n  newest-first default, sort, status filter, search, and the\n  delivered-only toggle; detail view replies, closes and re-opens.\n- typed API client with transparent JWT refresh, and an image picker\n  whose rules mirror the server''s.","tree":{"sha":"3ff801a620a48b82cf4d75b0831249a40597516d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/trees/3ff801a620a48b82cf4d75b0831249a40597516d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/commits/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58877698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commit/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f","node_id":"C_kwDOUMJTnNoAKDAxMzVlMGE4OTA0ZWYxNWM2NTllMmI0ODFiNTBkMDU1OTRiMWI3NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commit/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd","sha":"c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd"}],"sha":"0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/0135e0a8904ef15c659e2b481b50d05594b1b74f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58877698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:55:57Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:55:57Z","email":"ferifori@outlook.com","name":"fereidoon foroughi"},"message":"Add support ticketing API: orders, tickets, notifications\n\nBuilds the back end on top of the existing domain models:\n\n- notifications: pluggable email/SMS gateways (console placeholders) with\n  a NotificationLog audit row per attempt, so both channels firing for a\n  message is observable and testable.\n- tickets: serializers with image-only upload validation (type, size,\n  count), a single add_message service that keeps the denormalised\n  ticket state consistent, and customer + staff viewsets.\n- admin API: newest-first default ordering, sort/search, and the\n  delivered-only toggle.\n- seed_demo command producing orders in all five statuses and tickets\n  aged into each SLA colour.\n- 20 tests covering status-dependent form variants, one-ticket-per-order,\n  the one-week re-open window, upload rules, notification fan-out, and\n  admin filtering.","tree":{"sha":"2d53b438b9cdf0ceb5e580de0758394e706d2943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/trees/2d53b438b9cdf0ceb5e580de0758394e706d2943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/git/commits/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58877698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78","id":58877698,"login":"ferifori78","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODc3Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferifori78","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commit/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd","node_id":"C_kwDOUMJTnNoAKGMzN2ZlMzU0YTA1MTFkNzhmZWQ5OGFjNjA4NTdkOThjNWQ5ZGFkY2Q","parents":[],"sha":"c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technical-task/commits/c37fe354a0511d78fed98ac60857d98c5d9dadcd"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferifori78/golgift-technic