m/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/fbb53fe0e3ad2552cb1ee73066d291133e5e4db2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:05:26Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:05:26Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(messages): give a message sent over the management API a message id\n\nA message Studio sent through a broker''s management API (Jolokia) carried no message id, while one sent\nover the Core connection did. With more than one replica, a send lands on either, so a consumer saw some\nmessages without an id and could not tell a redelivery or a replay from a new message. Every sent\nmessage now gets one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d2e5bd7b1bf4a4c0c79cb6855eba3756edf90d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/c9d2e5bd7b1bf4a4c0c79cb6855eba3756edf90d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/fbb53fe0e3ad2552cb1ee73066d291133e5e4db2","verification":{"payload":"tree c9d2e5bd7b1bf4a4c0c79cb6855eba3756edf90d\nparent 5ab606a36e9a9dd86f61d3fd210e7a6d7a2768c8\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791464726 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791464726 +0200\n\nfix(messages): give a message sent over the management API a message id\n\nA message St