101565738a3f10e150f7f8bbc8ff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:37:45Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:37:45Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"feat(deploy)!: just up starts the HA stack\n\n`just up`, `down`, `logs` and `ps` now run deploy/compose/compose.ha.yaml: two Studio\nreplicas behind HAProxy on one Postgres, with the same .env as before. The one-time\nadmin password is read from the logs of both replicas. Postgres is not published to\nthe host. The UI stays on http://localhost:8080.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `just up` no longer starts the single-replica stack. Use\n`just up-single` and `just down-single` for compose.prod.yaml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c068986fb693d5730f004509aaecef2f14ecaa40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/c068986fb693d5730f004509aaecef2f14ecaa40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/1a52ca20e37101565738a3f10e150f7f8bbc8ff8","verification":{"payload":"tree c068986fb693d5730f004509aaecef2f14ecaa40\nparent 4fe0bb5fc926437cbc0b886e1610fdaf7aff768a\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791463065 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791463065 +0200\n\nfeat(deploy)!: just up starts the HA stack\n\n`just up`, `down`, `logs` and `ps` now run deploy/compose/compose.ha.yaml: two Studio\nreplicas behind HAProxy on one Postgres, with the same .env as before. The one-time\nadmin password is read from the logs of both replicas. Postgres is not published to\nthe host. The UI stays on http://localhost:8080.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `just up` no longer starts the single-replica stack. Use\n`just up-single` and `just down-single` for compose.prod.yaml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\