/api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/2114412cd46e3f49ea8e6e7838bea8cee9db3ae7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:47:57Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:47:57Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"refactor(settings): memoize the settings draft so its readers re-render only on change\n\nThe draft context value was a new object on every render. It is now\nmemoized on the form state it reads, with the form''s validators defined\nonce so they keep their identity. Readers focus a setting through\ndraft.focus instead of reaching into the form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26870b5ac6ddde4b57322574704385926b4de78b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/26870b5ac6ddde4b57322574704385926b4de78b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/2114412cd46e3f49ea8e6e7838bea8cee9db3ae7","verification":{"payload":"tree 26870b5ac6ddde4b57322574704385926b4de78b\nparent 74be3e97ada86324501a7e25e2abdc0ac0a52b2f\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791442077 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791442077 +0200\n\nrefactor(settings): memoize the settings draft so its readers re-render only on change\n\nThe draft context value was a new object on every render. It is now\nmemoized on the form state it reads, with the form''s validators defined\nonce so they keep their identity. Readers focus a setting through\ndraft.focus in