doit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:29:44Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(settings): keep Settings open for a numeric or repeated search\n\nThe router reads each address value as JSON, so a Settings link with a\nsearch such as ?q=123, or with q given twice, crashed the page (\"q.trim\nis not a function\"). The page now reads the search through the same\nparser as its route: a number is the text typed, and anything else is no\nsearch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4f8ec2f6fc6b12108c1de5198ad348d37c6d750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/f4f8ec2f6fc6b12108c1de5198ad348d37c6d750"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/ace08028d26c043639b1a4f1c3c5c8e34fbfe33d","verification":{"payload":"tree f4f8ec2f6fc6b12108c1de5198ad348d37c6d750\nparent 3f1933185d75381ee7b434d505137ed3a18708f6\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791433784 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791433784 +0200\n\nfix(settings): keep Settings open for a numeric or repeated search\n\nThe router reads each address value as JSON, so a Settings link with a\nsearch such as ?q=123, or with q given twice, crashed the page (\"q.trim\nis not a function\"). The page now reads the search through the same\nparser as its route: a number is the text typed, and anything else is no\nsearch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrHHDgACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC5mUhAAiwR/gohrLnYXVHHcV+lhZW5fwIxaBjNpVFsnjexf1VlryB9Ek0dDZcjt\nFrj8oKHz0zsxKaD7bRVBFTXQoo2SUU0O/0F0aaqwAkz008J8KR4poTA5TSbDHMjA\nVGqk82Fwnt3mugptmckvz4QNedCzV1OeC67m4SqgCHAZ4gDG80ocMW88DUes6HW+\na0bKRddB+xUcQbRF8+bwa4eJNiLleU/kPk/ETczQdbR6JuAmZtRrs88TgCTEjvwr\nK5rPIFfqPaV2ImCtWkhwxN