github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/9cf143e423830ac06e468f537513a1cca2341382/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:11:23Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:11:23Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(ui): close the dialog that sent an operation for approval\n\nWhen an approval policy held an operation, its toast said it was sent\nfor approval but the dialog that sent it stayed open and armed, inviting\na second submit: purging a queue, deleting messages, revoking a key,\ncreating a role or user, a group mapping, a team or a team''s member,\npattern or share. Each now closes, or its form resets, as on success.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eda72433d16c3b5fc4e640a66b01d631417a78ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/eda72433d16c3b5fc4e640a66b01d631417a78ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/9cf143e423830ac06e468f537513a1cca2341382","verification":{"payload":"tree eda72433d16c3b5fc4e640a66b01d631417a78ac\nparent 5a67c55de0ece3f07c1891a697f1d3bd60884e94\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432683 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432683 +0200\n\nfix(ui): close the dialog that sent an operation for approval\n\nWhen an approval policy held an operation, its toast said it was sent\nfor approval but the dialog that sent it stayed open and armed, inviting\na second submit: purging a queue, deleting messages, revoking a key,\ncreating a role or user, a group 