github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/77850de5fc01cbb8db014f6962c8ecceb1183291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:11:04Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:11:04Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(stream): end a user''s oldest stream instead of refusing a sixth\n\nA user could hold at most five streams of their own (the bell''s live\nupdates) per replica, and a sixth was refused with 429. A closed tab''s\nstream is only noticed when a write to it fails, up to a heartbeat\nlater, so reloading the console a few times in a row left the user\nwithout live inbox and approval updates, and logged an error in the\nbrowser, until the heartbeat cleared the dead ones. A sixth stream now\nends the oldest, which is most likely one nobody reads any more.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4179990c6fc3165685f3d379fad4f2dc4f4e6b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/4179990c6fc3165685f3d379fad4f2dc4f4e6b8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/77850de5fc01cbb8db014f6962c8ecceb1183291","verification":{"payload":"tree 4179990c6fc3165685f3d379fad4f2dc4f4e6b8b\nparent 293c75d36c8ca6ae5d42f780d0f1d71eac23d7c8\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432664 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432664 +0200\n\nfix(stream): end a user''s oldest stream instead of refusing a sixth\n\nA user could hold at most five streams of their own (the bell''s live\nupdates) per replica, and a sixth was refused with 429. A closed tab''s\nstream is only noticed when a write to it fails, up to a heartbeat\nlater, so reloading the console a few times in a row left the user\nwithout live inbox and approval updates, and logged an error in the\nbrowser, until the heartbeat cleared the dead ones. A sixth stream now\nends the oldest, which is most likely one nobody reads any more.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrHF9gACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC6BcQ//X/TcdjfiImiG60JuhJPdRI+rTSLSWZhWkA8JqWG3WM0Wo2tM+2lKjcDg\nKAsg9i6XFE7wpR65h4ubEri0ev4m7rcTCYrto6wvYmBJQ1R2dM+OAyLzRfpDN1p7\n88W12PuSiWdiMqePMCdTJCPh4Z1lI4oofUQhK91OyMSY0HPx3mPR19RW8fnh1hoc\n4g6IyhDGQNyR78LW2SnF660CCFFckCSrnS/RMqyeVSxLZsCf8kr2pPn+SYbs6Cch\nKISyk0ZSc1SAuAv9Z4nRuMbvAUf+SI61Fyv8b/L4f+WuO0CbpRk5zxiSf2UcTMV+\npeDACSVmNmRjiZJsCpRFskuReqgUkbVPfmdl781Nd8mhO/ixE1VxbkVKDpJzXTMS\nPcQO0BHDuSTbUejACRYtYsqTDqtoS70WtkPj7UOSftMW/BFzyEo98+xmg55zkbau\nOei8m4hgLMOPIoB8zhnJS8EOrg0dk35tLJgmhE3w3e6ag/Xb4prLLZHcqhg/4hgA\nKAZI0jgzAdSqbrq+8HLkjEkkRlxAV4iYGUMA2SsZrNRUoAOArpUexvurcA7HZ0bQ\nEelwUvxY4hReE+xzGNBq3uopOyaze+Zwye3MIIohcEixTzqmMBsx+pvz563eXnwn\np4UW5PiPDgW79FM/nnwvbFcG8drSY0VeidPV25tf7GK7m6FUSLA=\n=31id\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","orga