approvals): tell a viewer whether their session verified a second factor\n\nThe held-operation detail now carries mfaVerified for the current viewer, so\nthe console can warn an approver up front that a policy needing a second\nfactor will refuse them. Only the boolean is exposed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c69c68c728435841a2d9d45bb4b9f5d1ad53a68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/6c69c68c728435841a2d9d45bb4b9f5d1ad53a68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/704512b21b16170545ba4a1b4c685c079da26139","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c69c68c728435841a2d9d45bb4b9f5d1ad53a68\nparent 588925552c6a26d3a02207554697fba3019a73b7\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432067 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791432067 +0200\n\nfeat(approvals): tell a viewer whether their session verified a second factor\n\nThe held-operation detail now carries mfaVerified for the current viewer, so\nthe console can warn an approver up front that a policy needing a second\nfactor will refuse them. Only the boolean is exposed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrHFYMACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC4smQ/+OksVzfpoD6lOk5G16E5CnSLFFI0VhWRShBCE8Ax1RUs2fTo7UpdgxOsd\nhxFhkqpT/zFWbrNeKrMPQ13R6Jo6ltWc6gOVSEPthkQjlJU5imisuMsywrObqDR+\nsvDuOqs5AHF1LljEL9/DlqWcUgqm6BA/zZYg6Wd94wsTNM2wP4F7f+MDl2mHWt9X\nixPXppV8eenryrnHHDt8ulxM1J4WrCU3DCw3wh4w39ZCdsGX5ZwcIocN+pnDBUjU\nDZRn1SRLeSl5wmuDGmcORLDAbHzpEuerkypRgiNRKAfJKfdip67lRo271mEqQfLh\nx3SU1GGOcoBIbT3w7U+wBMgczg5Mb5ao3EhtWGSmYN1XAK4OoO+2tJWWqlz6iOV6\nX+5ZKvduQ/+bNkMVD0r3L6YidZNSk2/hjHA7uMddrtNh+nC4fVBlL4QZHzBz7SSr\nsE/FQGouNQB4re3DoWfe5c5gpA+aLiK87e4GiwC83Ez9GHpl/pNF2OqREb/kcC0o\ngRD8OvfDAvBNRBGfqFnMv3c0RbzPNFQtmJxQJ+kT+Xvk0hb8ikuohcntc2jNkU3n\nVwiI/uDqVt8ck+wluOMwrOZcgXRPtzkzf6H4