ttps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/9e8f0fe7406c6f65964e407b7fcc87b49be139c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:52:08Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:52:08Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"feat(gate): shorten a provider''s hold to the maximum instead of refusing it\n\nA plugin cannot read gate.max-hold, so a provider that asked for longer was\nrefused with approval-unavailable. The engine now holds for the maximum and\nlogs it. A hold under the 1 minute minimum is still refused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64470ef8971f605ab80ef429918b14d4e3cb3abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/64470ef8971f605ab80ef429918b14d4e3cb3abd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/9e8f0fe7406c6f65964e407b7fcc87b49be139c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 64470ef8971f605ab80ef429918b14d4e3cb3abd\nparent cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431528 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431528 +0200\n\nfeat(gate): shorten a provider''s hold to the maximum instead of refusing it\n\nA plugin cannot read gate.max-hold, so a provider that asked for longer was\nrefused with approval-unavailable. The engine now holds for the maximum and\nlogs it. A hold under the 1 minute minimum is still refused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrHE2gACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC6YVRAAzFmuiwX8ryR2YpPrevUdJNkC/mzlBC0+rQuGYLiy/6+qyjLNPkLUeHG0\nILwzsz8OcwWGWjMMqDInCSxNoLudHlJR21xncWmbv6yQrT0zZ/eq/ZJV0EqZHNPY\ntiRBLBli/WTCg0czSHmp1KFeivufNgdADhbX+Zpk/NzBTDcE42Ml3QhCoXmH+Fy8\nrbyfxy0lUjUMxV2S+5+5K9n9yI/02mKG7CGoCoq/PI0CJC1p78v/kVZDY1aedkQ1\nOJosNwTFkFf81UuLoYms9EtkZ8TS2/HQCK0QxGfE0DhH2/t0m//fDPKkHDmG+Mz5\nbVXflWvUVwIubDCGY6IXC5ZyfHzhcNshWJzZcHTVxJN5xZ9NtpW4FLDfGbUp/Oml\nPR1CpU5p3Er7Kye4v8iUy2O1YbGi/ApsDHVlB5B2HSL8BW4pKUo0deI+l2bEMgNg\nua4YwmuwgOkE9A1qFfjMyIRmnF5Wo+s32gl1Q7LgnF30jXp4B2ZUc+1QpV+erR+q\nTcO+EUT+gk6aTYTlnBB8OHWL5NqVtz+HFVmBYyIapNaji4EGalllR0BqWo3Bp6vq\nLbn4vsoS6VXOwOy/n78MqIzcWhUKj/FsppJ0hEWRK4KUgWriagf8918Kkmjm7pp7\neLBd2xyfa7jUZgqSUYoh/+fnWx6HnCMW/gwKgS6WAObT9Z2jyus=\n=Ab9Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commit/9e8f0fe7406c6f65964e407b7fcc87b49be139c4","node_id":"C_kwDOUMy6idoAKDllOGYwZmU3NDA2YzZmNjU5NjRlNDA3YjdmY2M4N2I0OWJlMTM5YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commit/cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d","sha":"cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d"}],"sha":"9e8f0fe7406c6f65964e407b7fcc87b49be139c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/9e8f0fe7406c6f65964e407b7fcc87b49be139c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:48:14Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:48:14Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"feat(alerting): make a plugin''s notices idempotent with a dedupe key\n\nA plugin relay keeps its cursor in its own database, so it cannot commit\nthe cursor and the notice in one transaction. OutboundNotices.enqueue now\ntakes a required dedupe key (at most 200 characters). Queueing a key the\nplugin already used is a silent no-op, enforced by a partial unique index\non (source, dedupe_key), and does not count toward the hourly cap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"825ee2e56eade3ed9a0021e7eab9aaa8b1c0d52f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/825ee2e56eade3ed9a0021e7eab9aaa8b1c0d52f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d","verification":{"payload":"tree 825ee2e56eade3ed9a0021e7eab9aaa8b1c0d52f\nparent ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431294 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431294 +0200\n\nfeat(alerting): make a plugin''s notices idempotent with a dedupe key\n\nA plugin relay keeps its cursor in its own database, so it cannot commit\nthe cursor and the notice in one transaction. OutboundNotices.enqueue now\ntakes a required dedupe key (at most 200 characters). Queueing a key the\nplugin already used is a silent no-op, enforced by a partial unique index\non (source, dedupe_key), and does not count toward the hourly cap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDk