sudoitir/artemis-studio/commit/ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea","sha":"ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea"}],"sha":"cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/cb134cab06a21ac302a1f07f34ed5754cf86a78d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:44:20Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:44:20Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"feat(plugins): give each plugin an OperationGate for its own operation types\n\nA plugin could register a gated operation but not run one, because the\nengine was never exported. Each plugin now gets an OperationGate bound to\nits id, through the same scoped-bean mechanism as the held operations. It\nrefuses, with an IllegalArgumentException, any operation whose type does\nnot start with <pluginId>:, so a plugin can gate only its own work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fe187672a7f9d516ea80853b77e65c08dd5a349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/0fe187672a7f9d516ea80853b77e65c08dd5a349"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/ae452c784816d14ae161934ea1f16e26af7b17ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fe187672a7f9d516ea80853b77e65c08dd5a349\nparent 02cb00aeec896eb09a490fdeaf0738bf3036774d\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431060 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791431060 +0200\n\nfeat(plugins): give each plugin an OperationGate for its own operation types\n\nA plugin could register a gated operation but not run one, because the\nengine was never exported. Each plugin now gets an OperationGate bound to\nits id, through the same scoped-bean mechanism as the held operations. It\nrefuses, with an IllegalArgumentException, any operation whose type does\nnot start with <pluginId>:, so a plugin can gate only its own work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrHEZQACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC7CXBAAs6W2QWnRXjuwwl8eRuyM6gbPG1YWlqTETePxcDrg8d9W7z5xWdvp3wVA\ng3Qb/Czi8mbOHPlHAijKCWSTq2JfOUhG0XYBqKruQrhFWkEwnxec+VBHCGca2/TX\nkfUXyYxa3CTzO5Pe1ZZFrSD7Sj0oIZ8dFe1PwZvWZkXrgP5m2fZ0my2+pgpAmzYD\nwQlhOiZ+kj6Ncrd8Ykq3tiwBKpS4CprO13vL1VBc7JX1ZyY/ERg3H9ziezFHtsre\n1v48MZ/df9/PufrxK+CjUHiSgfAc+EiSyYGkapxWsRnDTBI2QyTEVttq5ekuXq8P\nyg92yKAfX24hv+j1AF3qLSsRL6KSkoWHs6ClD8htVQgYQw9nqe1ry46fDMzyTsfR\n8h/Z44ur4co578jaWuib+tTEN0LCgiY51kkv+aAuR9vQ7rReq90bhlgLhaZZUhb5\nHhLYkCWtjw6I1m7zZYIy3nsntIampaF87+PCtsLhGUZyVvWMtNIagwmnXYIduv3w\n4sYebcpmqSQpI8TBvwF2AWqGIVjmfr5Diqh0ZBmwSlahJkw8fkCkRn24uDwBWGUJ\n1a5MtNpPVHImF8m