e exactly when it\ncan reach the gate, and that every mutating endpoint of a gated service is gated or listed with\nits reason. A plugin jar that declares an approval provider holding everything holds a purge made\nover HTTP, a second person approves it over HTTP, and it runs once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrGwrwACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC7TPRAArhG6x+ZD0gpRwnHZiDdEz+/29LpNlxcxR0EcZxJh2TkAwQ5VvZRZSF5q\nvt4EkCkHzdJb04bFj0YSfMuboKX1dtYKSV8OlpqP5xkkRkdNCNEYreXudWdsQV39\n1iizPwTbSvacEY5FRXKiDT4ex7qjiXd+jRIwmsSPFJ/0EuVxiN7zTpdjE1bPBbJn\nc4jNiuysY06+Lw6UeSxMeatU1AnYHBv1VIDYPx+f0l1dkw5xgr2gJY1jYOlcI6YV\neqwV/D7Of5fGiGxtQdyQsKUlncOKTMmcYoQdk9Xj1tSEm05petIqCuJOK9PXd3MR\ncHQaIsdEKfAFGikev2e8HWa0ckE8Pcu8X/0qXQKGRf5MxH1+oaOipK0HN65mk1rq\nMXp1jRlB9HwSith2gzXQyUiAltfmzj25PTvVd96b/VmWZOYHPCZbYjuMkyqaDuQ3\nuJ1QVomBK/QLCmWOGiagPwcaWFABKBepgckJS1fTxGF1DBzwVHyRVJsotBMhD6E7\nhJVIp7qMw2P9Isiac+0nJgMafoKfiE95fXKR2fxq2oK8TQgv9b+7lqRML3CfWqEQ\n5DNFV+jo2WCaHsGa1iyIE5ymfOJg8TiQrAbYNChquiVezS1L6XZC5UEJNkgkq5eB\nqFQ3MPF6kLMlmgvoJeD3bD1gnGpIB2FLMUNZDDfHHVWJRsPlHgI=\n=46NQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http