f3363c33e8563ccadf05","node_id":"C_kwDOUMy6idoAKDA1YzgzYTAxMmNhYzdiODJiNTkxZjMzNjNjMzNlODU2M2NjYWRmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commit/23cf268283234eda8098a979ccc65bd25d845832","sha":"23cf268283234eda8098a979ccc65bd25d845832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/23cf268283234eda8098a979ccc65bd25d845832"}],"sha":"05c83a012cac7b82b591f3363c33e8563ccadf05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/05c83a012cac7b82b591f3363c33e8563ccadf05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/23cf268283234eda8098a979ccc65bd25d845832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:29:01Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:29:01Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(approval): end an operation''s coverage when the work that continues it ends\n\nA covering ticket used to stay honoured for as long as anything still referenced it, so an\noperator captured inside an allowed or approved operation could run uncovered work under it\nlater. The gate now holds the ticket for its action, the worker hand-off takes a lease on it when\nit captures the operator, and the first run of that operator releases the lease when it ends; the\nticket is revoked when the last hold ends, and a released lease no longer carries it, so later\nwork goes through the gate again. A bulk run''s queues, run on its own thread after the request\nreturned, are still covered.\n\nThe bulk gate test also lets the gate through before the shared clean-up, which resets settings\nthrough the gate now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdd3ce758e230785704a2e8e84ba87172ec8d337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/bdd3ce758e230785704a2e8e84ba87172ec8d337"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/23cf268283234eda8098a979ccc65bd25d845832","verification":{"payload":"tree bdd3ce758e230785704a2e8e84ba87172ec8d337\nparent e4c660fb800c03025ac3d8bd1e41891565efaf04\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791408541 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791408541 +0200\n\nfix(approval): end an operation''s coverage when the work that continues it ends\n\nA covering ticket used to stay honoured for as long as anything still referenced it, so an\noperator captured inside an allowed or approved operation could run uncovered work under it\nlater. The gate now holds the ticket for its action, the worker hand-off takes a lease on it when\nit captures the operator, and the first run of that operator releases the lease when it ends; the\nticket is revoked when the last hold ends, and a released lease no longer carries it, so later\nwork goes through the gate again. A bulk run''s queues, run on its own thread after the request\nreturned, are still covered.\n\nThe bulk gate test also lets the gate through before the shared clean-up, which resets settings\nthrough the gate now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrGuZ0ACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC56gxAAhyOJXw+7IhWdh/aVGqzoMYABKm3vCfOj9/InXJmLpNKTg1gltR9pLcYt\nsfyDB1MGg3x1EkfM6Eh0hA8FeS2RuV/MM7/su4VM3DdEvAZ+z1EAh6pux552bVkV\nB9/MLrdUKoTtMxwwX3pUcywz5HsSgEMDoDalGTq5WgfUUSVsmsrYx340UPSJCbot\nliTbp7TwHRj6O53nyPdxEben+KvlEcIOTe3r0EUGa6BGHuF4R1Uh3JHWDL49w9J+\nT/GfNu/N+cRP+tyCc7upVtlfqoRqGY5DX/h2bOBJqVJTYaj3cPp3CIqYtRFnZjUd\nRfWW7zco+UsYOQbg3ux3KdeFAMfvr89uGfgihU8TlPrLrGFe/IvDJ5Aa1OzwnD6x\nDf0219mCUQfkFcfyK81jN6Im5GekdvwNCSgXyE+t+fCs6tZJVCqAfQwpyZinYEdH\nl2zZM9H9qDOopqVhPNn316x26TfZqKI4C3zbUzf35kQRAHtmuDpzW6IqBAAXJSB9\nG7r2loew+3toz0OjAvYG6Kr67S7Z/yYzeuON1QhtMygP3ZxlaI30rHzrtMU4m8gv\n8CKp7FVaNndTBmperF7vMBHjr9QDIkO/Boz2W9YFU8qvcFmWs7kNVZ7bskbFxf1s\no0zV2yZRGo8LHxw3Oz6I9Ox2Zc0Mfiv6RhmMp2yURQ9Y884FdFM=\n=Pmf+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_typ