''s choices by what they do\n\nThe review dialog''s table is named \"Changes to request\" when the draft goes for\napproval rather than \"Changes to apply\". Leaving with unsaved changes offers\n\"Stay on this page\" beside \"Discard and leave\" instead of a bare Cancel. The\nsearch''s screen-reader status says \"Showing modified settings only\" when only\nthe Modified only filter is on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7165d61f3f45baf7ce7d5117fc6b75ab25970928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/7165d61f3f45baf7ce7d5117fc6b75ab25970928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/9943c8f323e232bdea3a3b40d19d74df9f7da2e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 7165d61f3f45baf7ce7d5117fc6b75ab25970928\nparent 0b4364ccc3241ba1abc1cb88a7f2361d43023d75\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791407443 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791407561 +0200\n\nfix(settings): name the review table and the leave dialog''s choices by what they do\n\nThe review dialog''s table is named \"Changes to request\" when the draft goes for\napproval rather than \"Changes to apply\". Leaving with unsaved changes offers\n\"Stay on this page\" beside \"Discard and leave\" instead of a bare Cancel. The\nsearch''s screen-reader status says \"Showing modified settings only\" when only\nthe Modified only filter is on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrGtckACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC6yYQ/+LCIRx6A9CGSB9v2SEA2EE6rtNzkGkge4iaVXgi5AEapDAi+Dlx29LxLC\naHHBP58pRq0U5/7xfBDTe7qDRADoWRgkmgQD6Ds1S30FJFkP4Z//BamnbhhgeGJu\njS4AAgxg0wEVbgWhvoylV+wNE/soit+cmb+FBVqV1j1bub0gAYQq3yD8ybqO3HQS\nIu++Ynfx7cWbD/jyc//H+MNOlapvM6ywekYy0UYKRyNPbbBObyPamRRlB168EVPX\nxICXzVokNiSXjDgCviX7DmoVogZRCjEaDsF5D09B1CWdXf6MhaFlb++H/p1OhIV0\niR1rTFtA/k4UvHWXL4aQdeuSMdjKYzKpog