gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/commits/a804c1f5c254291463f7611cd139501a8384ac85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:05:36Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:12:41Z","email":"sudoit.ir@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Amirabdollahi"},"message":"fix(ui): start static table headers where their cells start, and drop the Columns control from fixed diffs\n\nA static table''s header cells are native th elements, which browsers centre, so\nevery header sat off its left-aligned column. Headers now start where their cells\nstart; number columns still end-align both.\n\nA static DataTable takes columnsMenu={false} for a short fixed set where every\ncolumn is needed. The settings review dialog and the approval''s change table use\nit, so they no longer offer a Columns chooser with nothing to choose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b48b5c21dd5abba8ded3c555a3bef7d5a734473a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/trees/b48b5c21dd5abba8ded3c555a3bef7d5a734473a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudoitir/artemis-studio/git/commits/a804c1f5c254291463f7611cd139501a8384ac85","verification":{"payload":"tree b48b5c21dd5abba8ded3c555a3bef7d5a734473a\nparent 0b4ff357026aeadd577daeeae8ffc3a0c8780662\nauthor Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791407136 +0200\ncommitter Mahdi Amirabdollahi <sudoit.ir@gmail.com> 1791407561 +0200\n\nfix(ui): start static table headers where their cells start, and drop the Columns control from fixed diffs\n\nA static table''s header cells are native th elements, which browsers centre, so\nevery header sat off its left-aligned column. Headers now start where their cells\nstart; number columns still end-align both.\n\nA static DataTable takes columnsMenu={false} for a short fixed set where every\ncolumn is needed. The settings review dialog and the approval''s change table use\nit, so they no longer offer a Columns chooser with nothing to choose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEgW2y6iVBnyvPOVkLsHEkFZDkDC4FAmrGtckACgkQsHEkFZDk\nDC547w//eR4JSP5QcQ3p4UQhDw/KF3+jQyzdq51w++sf9P7m0d2S8Tv4/67paYBU\nNA+WqT9o7i4wJmkDzuASkiWlCwczNwgWB2eyr5z1JGzJzj3hzRVhHiiAHZmihpD2\ngRiq/ur4+dnchgAoC4jxYe2aKbLr3/uZaohyJ20fo8MM+eRnTYGud0EFJnPOkPIW\nyjcMcQ0Xis/q5Ri/mn7/2Quni112zR/RjhRbCkzOd/HzYy+pZRBDboQLFtETXgp3\nTJ5sJvThlqyUOrNWfnuFRCaMvKV57Gk7K3rMNrsojJ2jI6UBkgTaawuC7DqmezOa\nX57VsRYS8kDUtwvm9OLrIqbE0J8bY5TD28hxq3YyXDQpJjWJnF8GEUuqi5MinI/+\nmli1OcNKLjkl/fr0OdsNBnxB0XSJOF4SayY2p7hoqDBeouRHwNYul1CLgSEeq7//\nP0t2EHgGeb7l7YGvnZ/A1u+mEPbKlrnJv0jwPStxqhO5eAqTEbYTIKjfc7PtDuKC\ne+68cZgZH6RBfSTa6q1LHd1/KaH0xx1b+fd7JzcWYLsrzLfdiG40vcIwJJXs7Y3u\nua7fNTo2N1PUJ+h3UtTu9w4GhEt1sfnl7YNrx4qAsu6+LigECAxWPBiPauRh4//V\nbzU/WoGYiY6VKm8IrnE2hM8PSdMaRDxKNDpzCZielWmJPoDWLXA=\n=YQXy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108562235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudoitir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudoitir","id":108562235,"login":"sudoitir","node_id":"U_kgDOBniHOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github