.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T08:40:57Z","email":"peter.gabor04@gmail.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"message":"Add secure local assistant bridge integration\n\nIntroduces a new opt-in assistant bridge that runs on authenticated loopback HTTP with strict host-owned allowlists and schema validation. The bridge supports session-based command execution, audio controls, scoped data/event publishing, plugin command acknowledgements, and guarded state/event reads.\n\nWires assistant startup into app bootstrap via a dedicated composition module, adds environment-driven bridge configuration loading, and includes broad tests plus an in-memory smoke host tool to exercise the production bridge without full runtime dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"76134cc8b51f6c95e3bd427168b4f40755fdbe37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/trees/76134cc8b51f6c95e3bd427168b4f40755fdbe37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/commits/c8eb5d4efce8e88d6c1a829eabf6c1f6999837fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30007117?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gaborboy95","id":30007117,"login":"Gaborboy95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDA3MTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.