hub.com/users/Gaborboy95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/commits/b437f2e98ae8c4365d84ca5009ad00a7c41e5aa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:20:14Z","email":"peter.gabor04@gmail.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:20:14Z","email":"peter.gabor04@gmail.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"message":"Add external vehicle integration discovery\n\nIntroduce a full external vehicle integration flow: manifest parsing (`vehicle.json`), bundle discovery from `ARGO_VEHICLE_INTEGRATIONS_DIR`, duplicate profile detection, and non-fatal malformed bundle reporting. Wire discovered profiles into vehicle profile composition, preserve discovery errors for explicitly selected broken profiles, and select the active bundle’s plugin directory as Veloce’s default (while keeping `VELOCE_PLUGIN_DIR` override precedence). Also add an example integration bundle under `tool/vehicle_integrations` plus focused tests for manifest parsing, discovery behavior, profile composition, runtime configuration, and end-to-end plugin loading.","tree":{"sha":"1781026e0d94cfde2eef21caa3fbc3ce8625448a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/trees/1781026e0d94cfde2eef21caa3fbc3ce8625448a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/commits/b437f2e98ae8c4365d84ca5009ad00a7c41e5aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30007117?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/followers","following_u