nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/commits/e105a333d03efb6083b572e05b77eaad9dc11124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:37:04Z","email":"peter.gabor04@gmail.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:37:04Z","email":"peter.gabor04@gmail.com","name":"Péter Gábor"},"message":"Add vehicle profile & capability system\n\nIntroduce a vehicle profile model and capability system used to declare and query vehicle features. Adds VehicleProfile, VehicleCapability, VehicleProfileRegistry, selection logic, built-in profiles, and ProfileVehicleCapabilityService. Composes and registers the active profile via registerVehicleProfileServices and integrates it into bootstrap. Includes comprehensive tests for composition, registry, selection, and capability service. Ensures deterministic ordering, validation of IDs/display names, immutable capability sets, and a conservative default ''generic'' profile.","tree":{"sha":"db7c9e64f3c2d9885d67b4fd25f4bf7b231f01d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/trees/db7c9e64f3c2d9885d67b4fd25f4bf7b231f01d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaborboy95/project-argo/git/commits/e105a333d03efb6083b572e05b77eaad9dc11124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30007117?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaborboy95/following{/other_us